pluck-review (Pluck Review's helper, Pluck Studio and the NAS host) is built in Rust from the crates below,
which are linked into the program (Helpers/PluckReview/Cargo.lock; macOS, and Linux for the NAS image),
plus the Rust standard library (MIT OR Apache-2.0). Each crate's own licence files follow, as published on crates.io.

